  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can survive out of water far longer than your aquatic kin.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aquatic subtype.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can survive out of water for a number of hours equal to your Constitution score before you risk suffocation. If you already have the ability to survive out of water for a limited amount of time before suffocating or suffering other ill effects, that amount of time is doubled. If you do not possess a land speed, you gain a land speed of 5 feet. If you possess a land speed that is less than 20 feet, your speed on land increases by 5 feet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
